caseStudy:
  problem: "Trades businesses live or die by local search and phone calls, but many sites bury the phone number, have no clear prices and say nothing about the areas they actually cover."
  built: "A fast site with a three-step quote form, a dedicated emergency page with a tap-to-call button and what-to-do-now advice, a services and prices page, and 8 area pages for Derby neighbourhoods (Allestree, Mickleover, Littleover, Chaddesden, Spondon, Alvaston, Darley Abbey and Oakwood), each with its own local content for search. The quote form is a demo and doesn't send anything."
